# ============================================================================
# entropybroker - eb_client_egd Command Line Parameters Configuration
# ============================================================================
#
# This file configures the command-line arguments passed to the
# `eb_client_egd` binary. Due to systemd limitations regarding argument
# splitting, each parameter must be defined in its own variable.
# Combining parameters with spaces (e.g., "-I localhost") into a single
# variable is unsupported and will cause execution failures.
#
# Each variable below corresponds to a positional argument for the binary.
# Empty values result in no argument being passed for that position.
# ============================================================================

